---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { termsLastUpdated } from "../data/termsLastUpdated";
---
<!-- Load Base Layout -->
    <BaseLayout title="Terms of Service - RaccStarLogan" description="By commissioning me, you agree to the following Terms of Service. Please read them carefully.">
    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Commission Terms of Service</h1>
        <p>By commissioning me, you agree to the following Terms of Service.</p>
        {termsLastUpdated.sfw && (
            <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 0.95rem;">Last updated: {termsLastUpdated.sfw}</p>
        )}
    </section>

    <section class="article-section">
        <h2>General</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>I reserve the right to decline any commission for any reason, with or without explanation.</li>
            <li>These terms may be updated at any time without prior notice. The version in effect when your commission is accepted will apply to that commission unless otherwise agreed.</li>
            <li>You must be 18+ to commission me.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Pricing &amp; Payment</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>All prices are listed in USD.</li>
            <li>Payment is required upfront.</li>
            <li>Prices may vary depending on complexity, deadlines, or additional requests.</li>
            <li>Quoted prices are final unless the commission details change significantly. (e.g., adding more characters, changing the style, etc.)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Process &amp; Revisions</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>I will provide progress updates when possible.</li>
            <li>Revisions are allowed during the sketch phase.</li>
            <li>Additional revisions beyond the initial ones may incur extra fees (unless commissioning a custom design or reference sheet).</li>
            <li>Major changes will not be accepted once the shading/rendering stage has begun.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Usage &amp; Rights</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>I retain full copyright to all work I create (art, music, voiceover, etc.).</li>
            <li>Commissions are for personal use only unless otherwise agreed.</li>
            <li>I may display commissioned work in my portfolio or on social media unless requested otherwise.</li>
            <li>My work may not be used for NFTs, cryptocurrency, or AI training/generation purposes.</li>
            <li>You may post my work with proper credit.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Twitter/X Posting Rule:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>You must request a Twitter-specific export before posting.</li>
            <li>This version will be watermarked, lower quality, and slightly altered to reduce AI scraping.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Turnaround Time</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Completion time varies depending on complexity and queue.</li>
            <li>I may provide a start estimate, but it is not guaranteed.</li>
            <li>Rush orders may include an additional fee.</li>
            <li>If a commission is not completed within one year, it will be refunded based on the stage of completion.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Refund Policy</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>If I cancel a commission, a refund will be issued based on progress.</li>
            <li>If you cancel before work begins, you will receive a full refund.</li>
            <li>No refunds will be issued once the final stage of completion has already been started.</li>
            <li>For artwork: partial refunds may be issued after linework depending on completion stage.</li>
            <li>For audio: no refunds once work has begun.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Content Guidelines</h2>
        <h3>Will draw:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Original characters</li>
            <li>Fan characters (if applicable)</li>
            <li>Mild horror</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Will NOT draw:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Hate speech or discriminatory imagery</li>
            <li>Illegal content</li>
            <li>Anything I am personally uncomfortable with</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Additional Notes</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>I reserve the right to refuse or cancel a commission at any stage if it becomes uncomfortable or if the client violates these terms.</li>
            <li>Depending on the content, I may choose whether or not the piece is publicly displayed.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Agreement</h2>
        <p>By commissioning me, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms of Service.</p>
        <p>Failure to follow these terms may result in blacklisting from future commissions and/or legal action if necessary.</p>
        <p>For any questions or inquiries:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>Discord: @racc.star.logan</li>
        <li>Telegram: <a href="https://t.me/RaccStarLogan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@RaccStarLogan</a></li>
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:contact@raccstarlogan.com">contact@raccstarlogan.com</a></li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <br />
</BaseLayout>
